WEBVTT

00:07:27.485 --> 00:07:30.696
in attempt to buy an original
US Constitution copy.

00:07:31.405 --> 00:07:35.034
It usually takes longer than seven days
just to set up a company

00:07:35.075 --> 00:07:36.410
and open a bank account.

00:07:37.036 --> 00:07:40.998
Krause House is buying an NBA team
and LinksDAO a golf course.

00:07:41.457 --> 00:07:44.168
DAO members will likely
get to participate in key things,

00:07:44.168 --> 00:07:47.379
like who's coaching the team
or where the golf course gets built.

00:07:48.297 --> 00:07:52.259
PleasrDAO collects art
and digital assets like NFTs.

00:07:53.135 --> 00:07:56.263
They recently purchased
the only copy in existence

00:07:56.263 --> 00:07:58.516
of an unreleased Wu-Tang Clan album,

00:07:58.557 --> 00:08:01.185
and DAO members are now
the only people in the world